Scope
-----
The license above covers the code in this repository: skinaudit/, tests/,
validation/ and notebooks/. Every source file carries the SPDX identifier GPL-3.0-only and the
copyright line above.

It does not cover any dataset. The datasets audited here (ISIC 2019, ISIC 2020,
SLICE-3D, MILK10k, PAD-UFES-20, and the ISIC Archive collections HIBA, HAM10000,
PROVe-AI, Consecutive biopsies 2020 and Melanoma and nevus with histopathology) are not
included in this repository and keep their own licenses and terms of use. The
tables, figures and sample images produced from a dataset are published in that
dataset's own repository under a content license that respects the dataset's
terms (see LICENSE-CONTENT.md there).

